(Allah the Exalted choosing and shaping you for Himself has a sign\072 that you love with) Tj
T*
(your mind\054 because your heart becomes wholly Allah\047s\056 When this choosing) Tj
T*
(descends upon you as reality\054 not illusion\054 you see in yourself what you were not) Tj
T*
(used to\072 either ranks that age and time raise you to through striving\054 or a \042Be\054 and it) Tj
T*
(is\042 casting without effort or exertion\041 When you sense that your self no longer feels) Tj
T*
(with the heart\047s feelings\054 and that you have come to feel only with the mind and) Tj
T*
(through the mind \050logic\051\054 know that your heart has been completely emptied of all the) Tj
T*
(values of this world\056 You no longer love people with it\054 not even the piece of your) Tj
T*
(liver\054 your blood and your flesh\073 you no longer get angry for people with it\054 but have) Tj
T*
(come to get angry with the mind \050logic\051\073 you no longer grieve with it over worldly) Tj
T*
(fortunes\073 you have come to do all that with your mind \050with logic\051\054 not with your heart) Tj
T*
(and its human feelings\056 Only then will you feel that the scale of justice in you is finer) Tj
T*
(than a hair\054 and that your values and standards have become straight\072 firm\054 steady\054) Tj
T*
(noble\054 wise\054 never inclining\056 Blessed then\054 from you\054 is every beloved one near you\054) Tj
T*
(for he will see in you all the values of beauty\054 justice and excellence\073 and woe then\054) Tj
T*
(from you\054 to everyone who deserves punishment\041) Tj
