(From this introduction\054 one must understand the mental and psychological influences) Tj
T*
(and the way the mind is made which shaped any person\054 especially if he is influential) Tj
T*
(in international politics\054 so that we can gauge and anticipate his thoughts\054 leanings\054) Tj
T*
(orientations and vision\056 For the influence of unstable geography on mental structure) Tj
T*
(is a very large influence\054 the influence of the state of oppression that accompanies) Tj
T*
(the exile throughout his journey of exile is a very large psychological influence\054 and) Tj
T*
(the influence of exile on the exile\047s ability to shed the convictions of the collective) Tj
T*
(mind is considered great\054 because he was never one day part of a psychologically) Tj
T*
(harmonious\054 homogeneous human group \050a people\051\056 So he is of a different structure\054) Tj
T*
(and this different structure cannot be done justice by a book\054 let alone an article\054 but) Tj
T*
(in brief\072 the world today has two rival mentalities\054 one of them the composite) Tj
T*
(mentality of directed ideology\054 and the other the free one\054 fully independent of) Tj
T*
(ideology\054 because it did not submit to collective inheritances nor to directed) Tj
T*
(ideologization within a culturally and socially cohesive collective framework\056 Hence) Tj
T*
(the comprehensive picture will be clearer\054 always and not sometimes\054 in the mind) Tj
T*
(that exile formed from the very beginning far from the molds of stable societies\054 and) Tj
T*
(moved it early to a state of analysis\054 classification and very early sifting\056 So the) Tj
T*
(foundation upon which it was built is from the start different\054 as a mind\054 from the) Tj
T*
(foundation upon which the mind influenced by the collective state was built\073 hence) Tj
T*
(exiles have always been a state of complete liberation of the mind\054 and those who) Tj
T*
(dwell in homelands have a share of intellectual liberation\054 but in degrees lower than) Tj
T*
(the people of exile\041) Tj
